{"id":209,"slug":"209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Kiểu Dữ Liệu & Biến","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?","question_en":"What are truthy and falsy values in JavaScript?","answer_vi":"Falsy là giá trị bị coi là `false` khi đưa vào ngữ cảnh boolean. Có **đúng 8 giá trị**, học thuộc là đủ:\n\n```javascript\nfalse, 0, -0, 0n, '', null, undefined, NaN\n```\n\nMọi thứ còn lại đều truthy — kể cả những thứ trông như \"rỗng\":\n\n```javascript\nBoolean('0')      // true — chuỗi có nội dung\nBoolean('false')  // true\nBoolean([])       // true — mảng rỗng vẫn là object\nBoolean({})       // true\nBoolean(-1)       // true\nBoolean(' ')      // true — khoảng trắng vẫn là ký tự\n```\n\n**Lưu ý — số 0 và chuỗi rỗng là giá trị hợp lệ:**\n\n```javascript\nfunction render(count) {\n  if (!count) return 'Chưa có'   // count = 0 rơi vào đây, dù 0 là đáp án đúng\n}\n\n// đúng hơn:\nif (count == null) return 'Chưa có'\n```\n\nCùng lý do đó, `||` để đặt giá trị mặc định là nguy hiểm:\n\n```javascript\nconst limit = input || 20    // input = 0 → thành 20, SAI\nconst limit = input ?? 20    // chỉ thay khi null/undefined, ĐÚNG\n```\n\n**Chốt:** `??` và `?.` sinh ra chính là để xử lý nhóm bẫy này — nêu được liên hệ đó là điểm cộng.","answer_en":"Falsy values are those treated as `false` in a boolean context. There are **exactly 8**, worth memorizing:\n\n```javascript\nfalse, 0, -0, 0n, '', null, undefined, NaN\n```\n\nEverything else is truthy — including things that look \"empty\":\n\n```javascript\nBoolean('0')      // true — a non-empty string\nBoolean('false')  // true\nBoolean([])       // true — an empty array is still an object\nBoolean({})       // true\nBoolean(-1)       // true\nBoolean(' ')      // true — a space is a character\n```\n\n**The pitfall that actually bites — 0 and '' are valid values:**\n\n```javascript\nfunction render(count) {\n  if (!count) return 'None yet'   // count = 0 lands here, even though 0 is the right answer\n}\n\n// better:\nif (count == null) return 'None yet'\n```\n\nFor the same reason, `||` for defaults is dangerous:\n\n```javascript\nconst limit = input || 20    // input = 0 becomes 20, WRONG\nconst limit = input ?? 20    // replaced only for null/undefined, RIGHT\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** `??` and `?.` exist precisely to handle this family of traps — drawing that connection earns the mark","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Falsy là giá trị bị coi là <code>false</code> khi đưa vào ngữ cảnh boolean.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Có <strong>đúng 8 giá trị</strong>, học thuộc là đủ:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"false, 0, -0, 0n, '', null, undefined, NaN\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0n</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span></code></pre></div><p>Mọi thứ còn lại đều truthy — kể cả những thứ trông như \"rỗng\":</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Boolean('0')      // true — chuỗi có nội dung\nBoolean('false')  // true\nBoolean([])       // true — mảng rỗng vẫn là object\nBoolean({})       // true\nBoolean(-1)       // true\nBoolean(' ')      // true — khoảng trắng vẫn là ký tự\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — chuỗi có nội dung</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;false&#x27;</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>([])       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — mảng rỗng vẫn là object</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>({})       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27; &#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — khoảng trắng vẫn là ký tự</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý — số 0 và chuỗi rỗng là giá trị hợp lệ:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function render(count) {\n  if (!count) return 'Chưa có'   // count = 0 rơi vào đây, dù 0 là đáp án đúng\n}\n\n// đúng hơn:\nif (count == null) return 'Chưa có'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">render</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">count</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!count) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Chưa có&#x27;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// count = 0 rơi vào đây, dù 0 là đáp án đúng</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đúng hơn:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (count == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Chưa có&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p>Cùng lý do đó, <code>||</code> để đặt giá trị mặc định là nguy hiểm:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const limit = input || 20    // input = 0 → thành 20, SAI\nconst limit = input ?? 20    // chỉ thay khi null/undefined, ĐÚNG\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> limit = input || <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// input = 0 → thành 20, SAI</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> limit = input ?? <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// chỉ thay khi null/undefined, ĐÚNG</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Chốt:</strong> <code>??</code> và <code>?.</code> sinh ra chính là để xử lý nhóm bẫy này — nêu được liên hệ đó là điểm cộng.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Falsy values are those treated as <code>false</code> in a boolean context.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">There are <strong>exactly 8</strong>, worth memorizing:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"false, 0, -0, 0n, '', null, undefined, NaN\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0n</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span></code></pre></div><p>Everything else is truthy — including things that look \"empty\":</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Boolean('0')      // true — a non-empty string\nBoolean('false')  // true\nBoolean([])       // true — an empty array is still an object\nBoolean({})       // true\nBoolean(-1)       // true\nBoolean(' ')      // true — a space is a character\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — a non-empty string</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;false&#x27;</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>([])       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — an empty array is still an object</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>({})       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27; &#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true — a space is a character</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>The pitfall that actually bites — 0 and '' are valid values:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function render(count) {\n  if (!count) return 'None yet'   // count = 0 lands here, even though 0 is the right answer\n}\n\n// better:\nif (count == null) return 'None yet'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">render</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">count</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!count) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;None yet&#x27;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// count = 0 lands here, even though 0 is the right answer</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// better:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (count == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;None yet&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p>For the same reason, <code>||</code> for defaults is dangerous:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const limit = input || 20    // input = 0 becomes 20, WRONG\nconst limit = input ?? 20    // replaced only for null/undefined, RIGHT\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> limit = input || <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// input = 0 becomes 20, WRONG</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> limit = input ?? <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// replaced only for null/undefined, RIGHT</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> <code>??</code> and <code>?.</code> exist precisely to handle this family of traps — drawing that connection earns the mark.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Falsy","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy"},{"label":"MDN — Nullish coalescing operator (??)","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Nullish_coalescing"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/212-temporal-dead-zone-tdz-la-gi","title":"Temporal Dead Zone (TDZ) là gì?"}]}